<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57 (FIM 264.80).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57 (FIM 264.80).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-1/2 at $57 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 264.80 markka.</p>
<p>Helsinki's bourse was closed on Tuesday through Thursday for the Christmas holidays. On Monday in Helsinki, Nokia A closed down 0.50 markka at 262.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) was untraded on Wall Street on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed flat at $20-7/8 in New York on Thursday. The price corresponds to about 97.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
